subtrack (subtrack v{VERSION})

Compare spending between current and previous period

USAGE:
  subtrack compare <OPTIONS> [<period>]

ARGUMENTS:
  period           Period: monthly, quarterly, yearly (default: monthly)

OPTIONS:
  -h, --help                         Display this help message
  -v, --version                      Display this version
  -c, --currency <currency>          Convert all prices to target currency
  -a, --api                          Include LLM API usage costs
  -j, --json                         Output as JSON

